{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"创建低效/同质素材清理任务的异步接口，最多同时创建10个运行中的清理任务，配合「获取清理任务列表」、「下载清理任务结果」接口使用。清理是暂停该问题素材/该问题素材关联的创意，不是删除素材，也不会影响到计划下其他在投素材/创意。能够清理到的素材范围是当前正在投放中的素材。\",\"id\":\"file.video.material.clear_task.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/video/material/clear_task/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1764209655140366\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"file.video.material.clear_task.list\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"与创建素材清理任务接口配合使用\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取清理任务列表\"},{\"id\":\"file.video.material.clear_task.result.download\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"与创建素材清理任务接口配合使用\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"下载清理任务结果\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1764209655140366\",\"title\":\"创建素材清理任务\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2kcgZDiE\">创建低效/同质素材清理任务的异步接口，最多同时创建10个运行中的清理任务，配合「获取清理任务列表」、「下载清理任务结果」接口使用</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-H4IZCYk7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MFfMYFmC\">清理是<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>暂停</strong></span>该问题素材/该问题素材关联的创意，<strong>不是删除素材</strong>，也不会影响到计划下其他在投素材/创意</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8EAKWI3M\">如果营销计划下都是低效素材，使用清理工具后低效素材都会被暂停，但计划正常投放</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GiXXKeK6\">能够清理到的<strong>素材范围</strong>是当前【<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>正在投放中的</strong></span><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>素材</strong></span><strong>】</strong>，不在投素材不属于可以被清理的素材范围，即使传入也无法进行清理</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-DTlI4Rg8\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-dkk3ghMd\">低效素材：<a href=\"https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/doxcncThI89dZfnMjVLfrAr0c9g\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">低效素材说明文档</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-QE70t6CC\">同质化素材：<a href=\"https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/Sh16dMqcUorPB4xrHTzcleQenag\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">「同质化素材」说明文档（对外）持续更新</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-CmDg3EI4\" id=\"h346b9f0-CmDg3EI4\"><br/></h1><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1760324835167245%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22cpUcA%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-HAf5mFHb\" id=\"h346b9f0-HAf5mFHb\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-vRUWYUer\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/material/clear_task/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/material/clear_task/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1764209655140366\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RCQ0POV4\" id=\"h346b9f0-RCQ0POV4\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-TnzG2fJs\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Zi8cDWJ7\" id=\"h346b9f0-Zi8cDWJ7\">Header</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"thtdixl28-44zkevkh3tw000\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-2cgme1ou7y3o00\"><col data-id=\"c6otumxio-5j5syb5ddf0000\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/><col data-id=\"c6otumxio-ze9slyu6t8w00\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/><col data-id=\"c6otumxio-38ib28uyzs2000\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-lu4pkvvpdfk00\"><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-6p30wukvp0800\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-1qbvamivm20000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5p2zow9ker8000\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-1e5pwwrur4qo00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bugph5nrtcg00\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-44fw1s6o706000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-34em10cj0cg000\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-2jhujr5uixg000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-5o9l7x0zksw000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-avd3lk9i7gs00\">Access-Token <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zSDrh%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-48vqqjfy5fg000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2ssz4vcojyg000\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-x5tcpfx1ho000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2959kv9txmhw00\">授权access_token，可以通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"> 【获取Access token】</a>接口获取 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-r80r71suulc00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t14oj2scg-3gb77qmi44600\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4q2hhzbh3yc000\">Content-Type <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%220JITL%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t14oj2scg-102cvo2sruu800\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3iuqmri4rys000\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tbata35h4-41p9wvtmhu2000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3w1tadnf91s000\">请求消息类型</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dgidndzspnc00\">允许值: `application/json` </p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-PaLg24WT\" id=\"h346b9f0-PaLg24WT\">请求参数</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"thtdixl28-2d8t6umxohhc00\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-5sshc7wc3kg000\"><col data-id=\"c6otumxio-4h1dzam2vl0000\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/><col data-id=\"c6otumxio-2nqmwn0jpwo000\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/><col data-id=\"c6otumxio-1xxopcwi9me800\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-6j8huc4icnw00\"><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-5ia9ywcunhg000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-64vkccarm6s00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2lfai4a960a000\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-2wthddjiejc000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-va9w6cg67ts00\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-1ioot5iowixs00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3oxp9lkz9am000\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-3darv6fr73c000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-4qa32cmlu7i000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2m85mvnfpza00\">advertiser_id <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dx9vy%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-4kl97lbq3bc000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-54jdhgi9z8w000\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-2niqhuycg84000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3114oih3elc000\">客户id </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-2lafhlr7aca000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-2n3b9yn8iwa000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4rnxbiwpspa000\">clear_task_params <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4qiv%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-409gmzr5auw000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3sihb9nlk58000\">object</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-wwbk5hkboio00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-13zo9ronke8w00\">任务参数，若同时填写多项任务的参数，则最终返回各个参数的交集 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-ksarfgbpdhc00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-isfckvczd6o00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1k8dp1gsvvvk00\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%221at5F%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>material_source <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22is_custom%22%3Afalse%2C%22custom_content%22%3A%22%20%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GeOH6%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-nasacqc9nkg00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5cf2fffmq84000\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-3wefer25ddc000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3rrfmyvoilo000\">清理素材来源</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-20kkxuq8r92800\">允许值：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">QIANCHUAN</code> 千川、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">AD </code>营销平台 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-kosyvf4inzk00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-42l9i2ii6xq000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-274123izx1s000\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aLUEo%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>material_ids </p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-4v09s2zzgtu000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5pzkjrb28ds00\">number[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-4321z0b643w000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1qmidovkvla800\">待清理素材id列表，单次最多支持100个</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2egyekmjzev400\">注：清理工具的清理对象为所有<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>在投素材</strong></span>，因此当传入素材id列表中包含不在投素材时，该部分不在投素材将不会被清理。此情况下不推荐使用该字段进行清理，推荐使用clear_material_types字段进行清理。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1sjhv7c3dc8w00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-14w6y4v6nlj400\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3l2fwbuk2dk000\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IdlpA%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>clear_material_types </p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-3k2i6ybvo8a000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-7bfc4gd0n7k00\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-14xse9tykxfg00\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5bthpf9cvfs000\">清理素材类型，允许值：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">INEFFICIENT_MATERIAL</code>低效素材；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">SIMILAR_MATERIAL</code> 同质化挤压严重素材；<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">SIMILAR_QUEUE_MATERIAL</code>同质化排队素材</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ttbmpc9e37400\">注：该字段从当前<strong>在投的素材</strong>中扫描出需要清理的素材进行清理（推荐使用该方式），如果不传该字段，则默认清理这三个标签的全部在投素材</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-4w7qaruse1w000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-2hnze25pfoy000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-42ry8kqm5hu000\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A%221%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RdF6A%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>create_time_upper </p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-2wjony7uqdm000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-13glu5qm5i7400\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-5ok5lb17r74000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4654r21eyos000\">清理创建时间\"yyyy-mm-dd\"之前的素材，不包括这一天 </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-1rs803ps7gjk00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-2nnix4nce08000\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2hpvsg4bfeo000\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\